{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo contains the first chapter of the story driven incremental clicker Lemonade Apocalypse: The Great Filter. If you'd like to explore 27 different gameplay combinations and story endings, make sure to wishlist the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SUPPLY &amp; DEMAND SIM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At its core is the supply and demand mechanic. Use dubious means to manipulate demand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PRESTIGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo has a separate prestige system so that you'll be rewarded for trying the different paths, and playing through multiple times.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY UP UNTIL THE FACTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you get the factory you'll prestige this chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539910/extras/Slutt.png?t=1747944063\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose active or idle playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story focused players play active</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Number chasing people play idle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 base mechanic, with 3 branching game mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prestige that is exclusive for the demo, incentivising number chasing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branch exclusive mechanics and mini games</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539910?t=1747944063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539910?t=1747944063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539910/3ea6ecee16d6de067fdc195660933d2d5808ce77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747944063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539910/3ea6ecee16d6de067fdc195660933